# steps/free-names.md M1 (class D): a declaration's initializer read from a free name -- its names are reads, so k
# and n are dynamic inputs of their methods.  char: c n converts int 98 -> char 'b'.  Before M1: "unresolved name".
fn: peek () size_t
    size_t: r k
    return: r
fn: letter () int
    char: c n
    if: c = 'b'
        return: 1
    return: 0
fn: m () int
    size_t: k 9U
    int: n 98
    int: ok 0
    size_t: a 0U
    int: b 0
    a: peek()
    b: letter()
    if: a = 9U && b = 1
        ok: 7
    return: ok

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
